        <mxCell id="ipt" value="VLAN 10  MGMT     10.10.10.0/24   gw .1   (Proxmox eno1, IPMI, switches)&#10;VLAN 20  LAN       10.10.20.0/24   gw .1   (servers, NAS, WGR)&#10;VLAN 30  IoT        10.10.30.0/24   gw .1   (TV, Hue bridge — no LAN access)&#10;VLAN 40  GUEST   10.10.40.0/24   gw .1   (visitors — internet only, isolated)&#10;VLAN 50  TEST     10.10.50.0/24   gw .1   (sandbox / break-things lab)&#10;VLAN 60  VPN      10.10.60.0/24   gw .1   (Gluetun torrent egress — policy-routed)&#10;Tailscale  100.64.0.0/10  (overlay — MagicDNS *.tail-xxxx.ts.net)&#10;Public DNS  d2.lol  (Cloudflare)  →  *.d2.lol split-horizon via AdGuard Home" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=30;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440" y="90" width="520" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

